---
import AudioDspWidget from './react/AudioDspWidget';
---

<section id="about" class="py-12 sm:py-16 border-t border-white/10">
  <div class="mb-8 flex flex-col gap-2">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-400">
      <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-sky-400"></span>
      <span>Engineering & Systems</span>
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-white text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-title">How I Build & Work</h2>
    <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-xl">
      An overview of my daily-driver systems, backend architectures, and Linux desktop environment.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
    {/* Card 1: Backend & Full-Stack Systems (2 Columns) */}
    <div class="md:col-span-2 p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-[22px] bg-neutral-900/60 backdrop-blur-2xl border border-white/10 shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.12),0_16px_36px_-12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.65)] flex flex-col justify-between gap-5 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white/20 hover:-translate-y-0.5">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-sky-500/10 border border-sky-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-sky-400">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"></polyline>
              <polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-neutral-400 bg-white/5 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-white/5">
            Architecture
          </span>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-white text-lg font-bold tracking-tight">
          Backend Architecture & Relational Design
        </h3>
        <p class="text-neutral-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          I build web applications with an emphasis on reliable relational models, transaction safety, and straightforward execution paths. In Django and PostgreSQL, that means designing normalized table schemas, indexing query paths, and structuring maintainable REST endpoints without superfluous middleware.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-black/50 border border-white/5 font-mono text-xs flex flex-col gap-1.5">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-neutral-400 border-b border-white/5 pb-1.5">
          <span>// transactional ordering schema</span>
          <span class="text-emerald-400">atomic</span>
        </div>
        <div class="text-neutral-300 space-y-0.5">
          <div><span class="text-purple-400">class</span> <span class="text-sky-300">OrderSession</span>(models.Model):</div>
          <div class="pl-4 text-neutral-400">table = models.ForeignKey(Table, on_delete=models.CASCADE)</div>
          <div class="pl-4 text-neutral-400">status = models.CharField(max_length=20, default=<span class="text-emerald-300">'active'</span>)</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* Card 2: Audio DSP & Ambient Sound (1 Column) */}
    <div class="p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-[22px] bg-neutral-900/60 backdrop-blur-2xl border border-white/10 shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.12),0_16px_36px_-12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.65)] flex flex-col justify-between gap-5 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white/20 hover:-translate-y-0.5">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <AudioDspWidget client:visible />
      </div>

      <div class="pt-2 border-t border-white/5 text-xs text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed font-sans">
        Configured real-time PipeWire DSP filters on CachyOS to achieve broadcast audio clarity with <span class="text-neutral-200 font-mono">1.3ms</span> kernel round-trip latency.
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* Card 3: Wayland & Linux Rig (1 Column) */}
    <div class="p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-[22px] bg-neutral-900/60 backdrop-blur-2xl border border-white/10 shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.12),0_16px_36px_-12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.65)] flex flex-col justify-between gap-4 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white/20 hover:-translate-y-0.5">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-400">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"></rect>
            <path d="M3 9h18"></path>
            <path d="M9 21V9"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-white text-base font-bold tracking-tight">Wayland Desktop Environment</h3>
        <p class="text-neutral-300 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Daily driving Niri scrollable-tiling compositor on Linux. Desktop tools are built as native compiled Rust binaries using Slint UI and the Wayland Layer Shell protocol.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 pt-2 border-t border-white/5 font-mono text-[11px]">
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-white/5 text-neutral-300">CachyOS</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-white/5 text-neutral-300">Niri</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-white/5 text-neutral-300">Slint</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-white/5 text-neutral-300">Rust</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* Card 4: Full-Stack Systems Matrix (2 Columns) */}
    <div class="md:col-span-2 p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-[22px] bg-neutral-900/60 backdrop-blur-2xl border border-white/10 shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.12),0_16px_36px_-12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.65)] flex flex-col justify-between gap-4 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white/20 hover:-translate-y-0.5">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-400">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="9" ry="3"></ellipse>
              <path d="M3 5v14c0 1.66 4 3 9 3s9-1.34 9-3V5"></path>
              <path d="M3 12c0 1.66 4 3 9 3s9-1.34 9-3"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-white text-base font-bold tracking-tight">Full-Stack Stack & Tools</h3>
            <span class="text-xs text-neutral-400">Core technologies used across projects</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-neutral-300 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
          My primary stack spans server-side Python and Django with PostgreSQL, combined with Astro, React, and Tailwind CSS for client delivery.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-2 border-t border-white/5 font-mono text-xs">
        <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/5 text-neutral-200 border border-white/10 hover:border-sky-500/40 transition-colors">Python</span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/5 text-neutral-200 border border-white/10 hover:border-sky-500/40 transition-colors">Django</span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/5 text-neutral-200 border border-white/10 hover:border-sky-500/40 transition-colors">PostgreSQL</span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/5 text-neutral-200 border border-white/10 hover:border-sky-500/40 transition-colors">SQLite</span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/5 text-neutral-200 border border-white/10 hover:border-sky-500/40 transition-colors">React 19</span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/5 text-neutral-200 border border-white/10 hover:border-sky-500/40 transition-colors">Astro v5</span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/5 text-neutral-200 border border-white/10 hover:border-sky-500/40 transition-colors">Tailwind CSS v4</span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/5 text-neutral-200 border border-white/10 hover:border-sky-500/40 transition-colors">Git</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
